/D017	/	THIS IS THE PATCH TO PAGE ZERO THAT WILL CONTAIN THE ROUTINES
/D017	/	THAT WILL TAKE CARE OF THE CDFS AND CIFS.
/D017	/
/D017	/	CONSTANT USED TO FORM A CDF CIF CALL TO CIDPAT
/D017	/
/D017		CDIF00=CDF CIF
/D017	/
/D017	/	THE USER FIELD CONSTANTS
