/ PART OF SQUEEZE ROUTINE "CUDGAR"
/ FOUND END OF A UDK. UPDATE DIRECTORY IN BUFFER
/ AND COMPUTE NEXT UDK ADDRESS FOR NEXT ENTRY
/
CUDG80,
/D031	JMS  I	CURWUX		/ WRITE OUTPUT BUFFER (CURWUD)		/C024
/D031	RXEWT+2000
/D031	CUDBUF
/D031	CUUDKD

